      "item": "payment_method_for_difference_or_refund",
      "prompt": "Pick ONE on-file payment method (a single credit card or a single gift card) to use for any fare difference payment or for receiving any refund. If you’re unsure what’s on file, I can list your saved methods after you provide your user ID."
